---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/scenarios.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- the auth server: hello, the provider's sign-in, a ticket
@1000 conn#1 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#1: accepted on auth
@1000 conn#1 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#1: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#1 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#1 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#1 SignInOptions [example] nonce="f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970"
@1000 conn#1 sends ProviderLogin example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> check sign-in #1: example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback nonce=f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970
@1000 sign-in #1 checked: https://id.example alice
   -> store #2: identity login example https://id.example alice
@1000 store answers #2: login ok, account 1 None
   -> event: conn#1: account 1 signed in with example
   -> send conn#1 SignedIn example:alice 8c79… (32 bytes)
@1000 conn#1 closed: the client left
   -> event: conn#1: closed: the client left
-- the game server: the ticket, an empty list
@1000 conn#2 accepted on game from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#2: accepted on game
@1000 conn#2 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#2: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#2 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#2 sends TicketLogin example:alice 8c79… (32 bytes)
   -> event: conn#2: account 1 joined the game server
   -> store #3: load characters of 1
@1000 store answers #3: characters []
   -> send conn#2 Empire 0
   -> send conn#2 Phase 1
   -> send conn#2 CharacterList []
-- an empty account picks its empire, then creates a warrior
@1000 conn#2 sends CreateCharacter slot=0 Hero class=0 empire=3
   -> store #4: create Hero for 1 in slot 0 at (963400, 278200) empire 3
@1000 store answers #4: created #1 Hero in slot 0
   -> event: conn#2: character 1 created
   -> send conn#2 CharacterCreated slot=0 #1 Hero class=0 st=6 ht=4 dx=3 iq=3
-- select and enter
@1000 conn#2 sends SelectCharacter 0
   -> send conn#2 Phase 2
   -> send conn#2 MainCharacter vid=1 Hero class=0 (963400, 278200) empire=3 group=0 run=450
   -> send conn#2 Points 1=1 4=300 5=796 6=796 7=304 8=304 12=6 13=4 14=3 15=3 16=4 17=100 18=14 19=150 20=4 27=1
@1000 conn#2 sends EnterGame
   -> send conn#2 Phase 3
   -> send conn#2 GameTime 1000
   -> send conn#2 Channel 1
   -> send conn#2 EntitySpawn vid=1 (963400, 278200) race=0 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#2 EntityInfo vid=1 Hero empire=3 level=1
   -> send conn#2 Skills
   -> event: conn#2: character 1 entered as vid 1
-- walk 10 m east, arrive, talk, a ping and its pong
@1000 conn#2 sends CharacterMove kind=1 (964400, 278200)
@2500 conn#2 sends CharacterMove kind=0 (964400, 278200)
@2500 conn#2 sends SendChat kind=0 "hello"
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=0 vid=1 "Hero: hello"
@7500 tick
   -> send conn#2 Ping
@7500 conn#2 sends Pong
-- leaving saves the character where it stands
@67500 conn#2 closed: the client left
   -> store #5: save #1 at (964400, 278200) played 66s
   -> event: conn#2: closed: the client left
@67500 store answers #5: saved: Ok(())
